{"seq":5,"slug":"ide-extension-development","title":"IDE 插件与扩展开发","stage":"DONE","category":"editors-compilers","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ide-插件与扩展开发-简介\">IDE 插件与扩展开发 简介</h1><p>IDE 插件与扩展开发是提升开发效率和定制化开发体验的重要技术方向。通过编写编辑器插件，开发者可以将特定语言的智能提示、诊断检查、调试支持等能力深度集成到日常使用的开发环境中。本知识库系统介绍主流 IDE 平台的扩展开发技术，帮助你从插件使用者成长为工具创造者。</p>\n<p>本知识库适合有一定编程经验并对开发工具生态感兴趣的中高级工程师，尤其是希望为团队或社区构建专属开发工具的技术爱好者。无论你的目标是开发一个 VS Code 插件、实现一个语言服务器，还是为 JetBrains 系列 IDE 编写插件，都能在这里找到完整的技术指导。</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>VS Code 扩展开发</strong>从扩展的基本结构讲起，涵盖命令与菜单系统、WebView API 的使用以及测试与发布流程，帮助你在最流行的编辑器平台上快速构建功能完整的扩展。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>语言服务器</strong>深入 Language Server Protocol 的实现技术，从协议规范到服务端开发，从诊断与补全功能到增量解析优化，帮助你为任意语言构建跨编辑器的智能支持。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>调试器扩展</strong>讲解 Debug Adapter Protocol 的设计与实现，包括自定义调试器的开发、启动配置的设计以及调试界面的集成，让你能够为特定运行时或语言提供专业的调试体验。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>JetBrains 插件开发</strong>面向 IntelliJ 平台的插件体系，介绍 IntelliJ Platform SDK 的核心概念、PSI 与 AST 操作、代码检查与快速修复以及插件的分发与维护。</p>\n<p>建议学习路径：大多数读者可以从第1章的 VS Code 扩展开发入手，快速上手插件开发的基本范式。对语言工具链感兴趣的读者应重点学习第2章和第3章。使用 JetBrains IDE 的开发者可以直接从第4章开始。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vscode-extension","title":"VS Code 扩展开发","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/vscode-extension","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"extension-anatomy","title":"VS Code 扩展结构解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/vscode-extension/extension-anatomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"commands-and-menus","title":"命令系统与菜单集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/vscode-extension/commands-and-menus"},{"seq":3,"slug":"webview-api","title":"Webview API 与自定义 UI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/vscode-extension/webview-api"},{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-publishing","title":"扩展测试与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/vscode-extension/testing-publishing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-server","title":"语言服务器","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/language-server","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lsp-protocol","title":"LSP 协议详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/language-server/lsp-protocol"},{"seq":2,"slug":"server-implementation","title":"语言服务器实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/language-server/server-implementation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"diagnostics-completion","title":"诊断与代码补全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/language-server/diagnostics-completion"},{"seq":4,"slug":"incremental-parsing","title":"增量解析与性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/language-server/incremental-parsing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"debugger-extension","title":"调试器扩展","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/debugger-extension","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"debug-adapter-protocol","title":"Debug Adapter Protocol 详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/debugger-extension/debug-adapter-protocol"},{"seq":2,"slug":"custom-debugger","title":"自定义调试器开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/debugger-extension/custom-debugger"},{"seq":3,"slug":"launch-config","title":"Launch 配置与调试启动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/debugger-extension/launch-config"},{"seq":4,"slug":"debugging-ui","title":"调试 UI 定制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/debugger-extension/debugging-ui"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"jetbrains-plugin","title":"JetBrains 插件开发","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/jetbrains-plugin","docs":[{"seq":1